cludes older GLES games that target Android versions like 9 (if not older).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726834672/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726984804","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104179#issuecomment-2726984804","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104179","id":2726984804,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iinxk","user":{"login":"dsyze","id":59926550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5OTI2NTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59926550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsyze","html_url":"https://github.com/dsyze","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsyze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsyze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsyze/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsyze/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsyze/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsyze/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsyze/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsyze/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsyze/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T20:25:59Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T20:25:59Z","body":"> Can you reproduce this after switching to the **Mobile** rendering method in the top-right corner, then exporting the project again?切换到右上角的**移动**渲染方法，然后再次导出项目后，您可以重现此问题吗？\n> \n> Also, can you reproduce this in 4.4 which has [Swappy integration](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96439)? (If you're building export templates yourself, remember to set up the Swappy dependency before building.)另外，您可以在具有[Swappy 集成](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96439)的 4.4 中重现此问题吗？（如果您自己构建导出模板，请记住在构建之前设置 Swappy 依赖项。）\n> \n> > 2. I think that Android 15 specifically doesn't allow games to run at more than 60 FPS. That observation is based on my experience after updating my test devices.我认为 Android 15 明确不允许游戏以超过 60 FPS 的速度运行。这一观察是基于我更新测试设备后的经验得出的。\n> \n> My Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra is on Android 15 and can run any game at 120 FPS (unless it implements its own cap). This includes older GLES games that target Android versions like 9 (if not older).我的三星 Galaxy S25 Ultra 搭载的是 Android 15，可以以 120 FPS 的速度运行任何游戏（除非它实现了自己的上限）。这包括针对 Android 版本 9（如果不是更早的话）的旧版 GLES 游戏。\n\nSir, Switching to the Mobile rendering method does not help. I tried godot4.4stable, and I found that \"Engine.set_max_fps()\"can work when you are setting fps under 60, but if you try to set it above 60, it still locked to 60.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726984804/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727272898","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104179#issuecomment-2727272898","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104179","id":2727272898,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ijuHC","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T08:51:18Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T08:58:37Z","body":"It seems like in Android 15, the system automatically limit it to 60 when battery saver mode is enabled to conserve power, even if the device is capable of higher frame rates. Disabling battery saver removes this cap for me.\n\nAdditionally, the system may also reduce the frame rate when the device is overheating or in other similar scenarios.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727272898/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727276940","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104179#issuecomment-2727276940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104179","id":2727276940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ijvGM","user":{"login":"dsyze","id":59926550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5OTI2NTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59926550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsyze","html_url":"https://github.com/dsyze","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsyze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsyze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsyze/gists{/gist_id}","starre